flowchart TD
    A[Read the new table for the first time] --> B[Write what one row means]
    B --> C[Find the key and time/order columns]
    C --> D[Check format consistency]
    D --> E[Run the first quality check]
    E --> F{Can it already be compared directly?}
    F -- No --> G[Regroup into a sample-level table]
    F -- Yes --> H[Keep it as a directly comparable table]
